title: >-
  Stream-Temperature Gap Recoverability and Monitoring-Network Evaluation
abstract: >-
  Software for fitting-period artificial-gap stress tests, cross-network loss
  calibration, conditional-covariance lower bounds, recovery-model
  sensitivity, conformal diagnostics, and monitoring-placement replay. It
  does not establish reservoir causation or a transferable safe-fill rule.
  This citation is for software only; restricted observations remain excluded.
